        "detailed_description": "<h1>Current Status &amp; Future Plans</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Current:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few “workmates” have joined. <span class=\"bb_strike\">You’re no longer alone. When you’re stressed, chat with them; when you’re overwhelmed, call them in.</span> (Cut a part,personality-driven dialogue system. In the factory, everyone minds their own business—few are truly helpful.)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Finishing tasks is part of the design, but how you do them depends on your choices in the scene.</span> (Work is routine, but people are the core. The experience focuses on what kind of tasks exist, not rigid schedules or repetitive actions.)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Dialogue-triggered changes in workmates .</span> (Were removed.See point 1. Workmates repeat their own loops, and designing meaningful changes proved unproductive.)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Future:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">More work mechanisms and “workmate feedback” will be added.</span> (Done, their insights are always unique across different tasks—go discover them!)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">More dialogue topics to simulate real-life small talk.</span> (Cut,work is busy, conversations stay task-focused. Also, privacy matters, doesn’t it?)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New contact features and walkie-talkie system. (Not yet completed.)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Simulating real-world work dynamics: in reality, work gets done even when people aren’t present. And if you finish extra tasks but don’t report them…</span> (Photo-upload system is in its early stages. Stay tuned for updates when it’s fully integrated.)</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chemical Worker Simulator — A pioneering, unconventional simulation experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Work your shift, no pressure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Talk to coworkers, learn their quirks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > • Tedious tasks, emotional release</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Promotions and raises? Not likely</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Ordinary stories, lived in daily life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you're a student curious about the chemical industry and want a taste of real workplace routines, this is the perfect place to start</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you've worked—or still work—in the field and want to revisit the laughter and tears of the job, you’ll feel right at home;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you prefer to decide what to do and how to play, without being led by systems, this was made for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Here, you get a job and a group of coworkers. In every ordinary day, there's a story worth telling.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chemical Worker Simulator — A pioneering, unconventional simulation experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Work your shift, no pressure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Talk to coworkers, learn their quirks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > • Tedious tasks, emotional release</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Promotions and raises? Not likely</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Ordinary stories, lived in daily life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you're a student curious about the chemical industry and want a taste of real workplace routines, this is the perfect place to start</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you've worked—or still work—in the field and want to revisit the laughter and tears of the job, you’ll feel right at home;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you prefer to decide what to do and how to play, without being led by systems, this was made for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Here, you get a job and a group of coworkers. In every ordinary day, there's a story worth telling.</i></p>",
        "short_description": "Play as “牛大胆” in the “胆大牛化工厂”. You’re not the hero—just a worker on shift. But every chat, every task, carries a story.",
